## Default Workflows

1. First project setup: `skills-seed init`, then `skills-seed sync`.
2. First workspace setup: `skills-seed init --workspace`, then `skills-seed workspace add .`, then `skills-seed sync`.
3. Daily update: `skills-seed sync`.
4. Add an authoritative rule: `skills-seed rule --name <name> --content "<Markdown>"`, then `skills-seed generate skills`.
5. Add a durable task process: `skills-seed workflow --name <name> --content "<Markdown>"`, then `skills-seed generate skills`.
6. Debug file selection: `skills-seed preview files --mode incremental` before learning.
7. Pre-commit workflow: install the hook with `skills-seed hook install`.
8. Update the installed CLI: `skills-seed update`.
